%% Nested sub-project self.glp. As a descendant self.glp root, `greet` is an
%% entry point only when child/ is itself the loaded root — then this self.glp's
%% forwarded export of `greet` is aliased. When the parent is the loaded root,
%% this self.glp is not the root self.glp, so `greet` is not an entry point.
imported procedure leaf#greet.
exported procedure greet.
greet :- leaf # greet.
